---
permalink: /en/
title: "Palomino Islands Tour — Swim with sea lions in Lima"
description: "Sail with the pioneers of marine ecotourism in Peru. Palomino Islands tour from La Punta, Callao: swim with 5,000+ sea lions. Book on WhatsApp."
eyebrow: "Ecocruceros · La Punta, Callao"
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__media"><img src="/assets/img/hero-swim-lobos.jpg" alt="Guests swimming with sea lions at the Palomino Islands, Callao"></div>
  <div class="container hero__inner reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--c-mustard-300)">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>Swim with the sea lions of the Palomino Islands</h1>
    <div class="hero__rotator" data-rotator data-interval="4200" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="rot rot--lg is-on">Visit the Palomino Islands</span>
      <span class="rot">On comfortable, safe two-deck yachts</span>
      <span class="rot">Swim with sea lions</span>
      <span class="rot">Daily departures · by reservation</span>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">Sail the open Pacific with the <strong>pioneers of marine ecotourism in Peru</strong>. A yacht experience from La Punta, Callao, to a colony of 5,000+ sea lions.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/en/tour/" style="color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">{{ t.seeTour }}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__trust">
      <a href="{{ site.tripadvisor.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:underline">★ 4.6 · 193 {{ t.trust.reviews }} (TripAdvisor)</a><span>· {{ t.trust.years }}</span><span>· SERNANP · Green Destinations certified</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-block:var(--space-12)">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="trust-strip">
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum count" data-count="30">30</span> years of experience</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum">4.6★</span> · 193 reviews</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum count" data-count="5000" data-suffix="+">5,000+</span> sea lions</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum">30 min</span> from central Lima</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">The experience</p>
    <h2>A real encounter with Pacific marine wildlife</h2>
    <p class="lead">From La Punta's private pier we sail to the Palomino Islands, where you can swim alongside a colony of sea lions in their natural habitat.</p>
    <div class="grid cols-3" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <article class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><span class="tag tag--ok">Guaranteed</span><h3>5,000+ sea lions</h3><p>Optional swim beside the colony at the Palomino Islands.</p></div></article>
      <article class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><span class="tag tag--ok">Guaranteed</span><h3>Humboldt penguins</h3><p>And guano birds at the Cavinzas Islands.</p></div></article>
      <article class="card card--top-gold"><div class="card__body"><span class="tag tag--seasonal">Seasonal</span><h3>Whale sightings</h3><p>Possible in some months · not guaranteed.</p></div></article>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/tour/">{{ t.seeTour }} →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">What's included</p>
    <h2>Everything ready for your voyage</h2>
    <div class="media-split" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <div class="media-split__media media-split__media--tall">
        <img src="/assets/img/galeria/g13.jpg" alt="A family swimming with the sea lions at the Palomino Islands">
        <span class="media-split__badge">All included in your ticket</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>{{ icon("swim") }}<span>Swim with the <strong>sea lions</strong> in their habitat.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("bird") }}<span>Bird and penguin watching.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("guide") }}<span><strong>Bilingual</strong> tourism guide on board.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("vest") }}<span>Life vest throughout the entire voyage.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("wetsuit") }}<span>Wetsuits for swimming in the colder season.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("drinks") }}<span>Cold and hot drinks and snacks — <strong>unlimited</strong>.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("pill") }}<span>Seasickness tablets.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("anchor") }}<span>Boarding at our <strong>private pier</strong>.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("boat") }}<span>Two-deck yacht: 2 cabins, 2 restrooms, lounge and galley.</span></li>
        <li>{{ icon("shield") }}<span>Travel insurance.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><strong>Not included:</strong> S/. 26 (residents) / US$8 (visitors) for the protected natural area (SERNANP) entrance and boarding fee. No swimming ability required: you can enter the sea wearing a life vest.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/tour/precios/">{{ t.seePricing }} →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm" style="padding-block:var(--space-12)">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="factbar">
      <div><b>3½ hours</b><span>of unforgettable sailing</span></div>
      <div><b>30 min</b><span>from central Lima</span></div>
      <div><b>Daily departures</b><span>by reservation</span></div>
      <div><b>Private pier</b><span>in La Punta, Callao</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="media-split media-split--reverse">
      <div class="media-split__media">
        <img src="/assets/img/galeria/g7.jpg" alt="Group of guests enjoying the Palomino Islands tour">
        <span class="media-split__badge">Nearly 30 years of experience</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why Ecocruceros</p>
        <h2>The pioneers of marine ecotourism in Peru</h2>
        <ul class="feature-list" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">
          <li>{{ icon("clock") }}<span><strong>Nearly 30 years</strong> of experience, devoted to your comfort and peace of mind.</span></li>
          <li>{{ icon("anchor") }}<span><strong>Private pier</strong>: we depart from La Punta, 30 minutes from central Lima.</span></li>
          <li>{{ icon("boat") }}<span><strong>Two-deck yacht</strong>, with a lounge, restrooms and galley on board.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/nosotros/">About our company →</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sustainability</p>
    <h2>The "Eco" is not a label</h2>
    <p class="lead">We operate within a National Reserve, with low-impact practices and the backing of sustainable-tourism certifications.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/sostenibilidad/">{{ t.nav.sustain }} →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">What our guests say</p>
    <h2>4.6★ on TripAdvisor · 193 reviews</h2>
    <p class="lead">#10 of 97 attractions in Lima. Real reviews from guests who've already sailed with us.</p>
    {% if reviews and reviews.length %}
    <div class="review-carousel" data-carousel>
      <div class="review-track" data-carousel-track>
        {% for r in reviews %}
        <div class="review-slide"><article class="review-card">
          <div class="review-stars" title="5 of 5" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          {% if r.title_en %}<h3 class="review-title">{{ r.title_en }}</h3>{% endif %}
          <p class="review-text">“{{ r.text_en }}”</p>
          <p class="review-meta">{{ r.name }}{% if r.location_en %} · {{ r.location_en }}{% endif %}{% if r.date_en %} · {{ r.date_en }}{% endif %}<br><span class="review-source">via TripAdvisor</span></p>
        </article></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-nav">
        <button type="button" class="carousel-btn" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous review">‹</button>
        <button type="button" class="carousel-btn" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next review">›</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.tripadvisor.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the reviews on TripAdvisor →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sea cta-band">
  <div class="container center reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
    <h2>{{ t.from }} S/. 179 (residents) · {{ t.from }} US$69 (visitors)</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-inline:auto;color:#dff1f8">SERNANP fee not included. We arrange everything by WhatsApp.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <a class="btn btn--gold" data-wa-source="home-pricing" href="{{ t.wa.pricing | wa }}">Book on WhatsApp</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/tour/precios/">{{ t.seePricing }} →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
